Function {fn} has exposed error handling if
    Function {fn} catches a broad exception and
    Function {fn} has an uncovered error path.

Function {fn} has concentrated structural risk if
    Function {fn} is long and
    Function {fn} has many decisions.

Function {fn} needs error-path review if
    Function {fn} has exposed error handling.

Function {fn} needs structural review if
    Function {fn} has concentrated structural risk.
